"","parentId":"1778845478474-この問題を要件定義書としてmarkdownでまとめてください","turnParentId":"99a142f7-be6f-460e-9731-6201936dc917"},{"code":"d0 ... d(M-1)","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"d0 ... d(M-1)","language":"","parentId":"1778845478474-この問題を要件定義書としてmarkdownでまとめてください","turnParentId":"99a142f7-be6f-460e-9731-6201936dc917"},{"code":"d0 = d1 = d2 = d3 = d4 = 1","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"d0 = d1 = d2 = d3 = d4 = 1","language":"","parentId":"1778845478474-この問題を要件定義書としてmarkdownでまとめてください","turnParentId":"99a142f7-be6f-460e-9731-6201936dc917"},{"code":"f(i,j)","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"f(i,j)","language":"","parentId":"1778845478474-この問題を要件定義書としてmarkdownでまとめてください","turnParentId":"99a142f7-be6f-460e-9731-6201936dc917"},{"code":"U\nD\nL\nR","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"U\nD\nL\nR","language":"","parentId":"1778845478474-この問題を要件定義書としてmarkdownでまとめてください","turnParentId":"99a142f7-be6f-460e-9731-6201936dc917"},{"code":"T <= 100000","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"T <= 100000","language":"","parentId":"1778845478474-この問題を要件定義書としてmarkdownでまとめてください","turnParentId":"99a142f7-be6f-460e-9731-6201936dc917"},{"code":"cp != dp","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"cp != dp","language":"","parentId":"1778845478474-この問題を要件定義書としてmarkdownでまとめてください","turnParentId":"99a142f7-be6f-460e-9731-6201936dc917"},{"code":"struct Snake {\n    vector<Segment> body;\n};","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"struct Snake {\n    vector<Segment> body;\n};","language":"","parentId":"1778845478474-この問題を要件定義書としてmarkdownでまとめてください","turnParentId":"99a142f7-be6f-460e-9731-6201936dc917"},{"code":"struct Segment {\n    Pos pos;\n    int color;\n};","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"struct Segment {\n    Pos pos;\n    int color;\n};","language":"","parentId":"1778845478474-この問題を要件定義書としてmarkdownでまとめてください","turnParentId":"99a142f7-be6f-460e-9731-6201936dc917"},{"code":"struct State {\n    Snake snake;\n    vector<vector<int>> board;\n};","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"struct State {\n    Snake snake;\n    vector<vector<int>> board;\n};","language":"","parentId":"1778845478474-この問題を要件定義書としてmarkdownでまとめてください","turnParentId":"99a142f7-be6f-460e-9731-6201936dc917"}]}]